<view class="page"><text class="title">我的农事卡</text><block wx:if="{{context}}"><view class="intro small muted">{{context.identity.org}}</view><image src="/assets/card.jpg" class="media" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="small muted gap">研发方案示意，非实物照片。GPS、离线存储、BLE、NFC；不含Wi-Fi、震动或蜂鸣。</view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">A / B / C 作业设置</text><view class="field" wx:for="{{keys}}" wx:key="index"><text class="label">{{index === 0 ? 'A键' : index === 1 ? 'B键' : 'C键'}}</text><picker range="{{choices}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="choose"><view class="input picker-value">{{item}}<view class="chevron"/></view></picker></view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveConfig">保存目标配置草稿</button><view class="kv gap"><text>平台目标版本</text><text>V{{targetVersion}}（演示）</text></view><view class="kv"><text>设备确认版本</text><text>V{{deviceVersion}}（固定示例）</text></view><view class="note">新设置未获得真实设备回执，不表示已生效；旧记录按采集时配置解释。</view></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">离线记录与同步</text><view class="muted small">设备保存 → 手机读取 → 云端持久化 → 设备回执。真实协议与服务器待接入。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="simulate">演示读取一条离线记录</button><view wx:for="{{localEvents}}" wx:key="id" class="gap"><text>{{item.key}}键 · {{item.operation}} · V{{item.configVersion}}</text><view class="small muted">{{item.status}} / {{item.location}}</view></view></view><view class="success" wx:if="{{saved}}">{{saved}}</view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">办卡与补卡</text><view class="kv"><text>办理一张</text><text>100元</text></view><view class="kv"><text>挂失后补卡</text><text>100元</text></view><view class="muted small">真实办理、挂失与支付待接入。本页不收款。卡片尺寸与月充电续航为待工程验证目标。</view></view></block><view wx:else class="empty"><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="back">返回工作台</button></view><view class="demo-foot">模拟设备 · 未读取真实卡片 · 未上传云端</view></view>
